        "collapsible-row-3": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Directions",
            "icon": "clipboard",
            "content": "<p>Wet hair completely. Pump desired amount (dependent on hair length) onto palm of hand. Gently massage into hair and scalp until it lathers. Work the shampoo through the hair. For stronger lather, wet hair again and work in more shampoo. Rinse scalp and hair thoroughly.<br/><br/>This shampoo is designed to cleanse your hair without stripping it of its natural oils or drying out the skin or scalp.</p><p>It should be followed with our Coconut Conditioner.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-0": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ingredients",
            "icon": "plant",
            "content": "High-Purity Water  • charcoal-filtered, reverse osmosis, UV-sanitizedCocamidopropyl Bentaine • Naturally derived from coconut and palm-free. It is an environmentally friendly and biodegradable surfactant with mild chemistry.Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine • Naturally derived from coconut, palm-free, it is a biodegradable conditioning agent for hair and skin with high foaming and mild chemistry.Sodium C14-16 Olefin Sulfonate • This mild-surfactant helps grab oil, dirt, and grease. It is also derived from coconuts, palm-free and is biodegradable.Vegetable Glycerin (glycerin)* • Derived from vegetables. It is a biodegradable, powerful moisturizer that can increase skin hydration. Food-grade & Kosher.Coco-Glucoside •  A plant-derived, biodegradable surfactant. It is mild and safe for sensitive skin.Caprylyl Capryl Glucoside • A plant-based surfactant that increases lather potential with mild chemistry for sensitive skin.Polyquaternium 10 • Gives skin soft feel. Formaldehyde-free.Polysorbate 20 • Plant-based formula stabilizer. USP, food-grade, kosher quality, containing no dioxane.Sodium Gluconate • A natural mineral that helps remove minerals from hard water.Phenoxyethanol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Benzoate, Potassium Sorbate  • Food-grade preservatives. Used sparingly to prevent bacteria from growing in container.Essential Oils  and/or Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oils • ScentCitric Acid • Balances pH",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible-row-2": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Scent",
            "icon": "leaf",
            "content": "Winter Solstice\nWinter Solstice Phthalate-Free Fragrance Oil (Blend of Fragrance Oils Cedarwood Essential Oil, Peppermint Essential Oil & Spearmint Essential Oil)\n\n\n\nOur essential oils are hand selected by us from small farms all around the world. Purity tested. Quality assured.\n\nOur phthalate-free fragrance oils are aromatic compounds made of GRAS (generally regarded as safe) synthetics. These fragrances do not contain any chemicals on the California Prop 65 list known to cause cancer or reproductive harm ( such as phthalates, parabens, dyes, formaldehyde and more ).",
            "page": ""
          }
